Description: Implements binomial and Fisher's (2x2..2x6 and 3x3 so far) exact
    tests.  This is based on high-accuracy log-likelihood arithmetic from Hida
    Y, Li XS, Bailey DH (2001) <doi:10.1109/ARITH.2001.930115> and the Fisher's
    exact test algorithm in Chang et al. (2015) <doi:10.1186/s13742-015-0047-8>.
    Accuracy and speed of these functions compare favorably to their
    counterparts in the R 4.6 standard library.
